  "description": "Complete PostgreSQL metapackage for Excalibur: event sourcing, inbox, sagas, leader election, audit logging, compliance, and data access in a single package reference. The outbox is not registered -- its PostgreSQL store requires an application-supplied Excalibur.Data.IDb. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
